Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:01:31.20,HEADB,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\c&H8CDC4A&}德米纳尔 {\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\c&H8CDC4A&\fs44}7-{\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\fs44}5 {\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\c&H8CDC4A&\fs44}7-{\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\fs44}6(3){\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC} 弗雷 · 赛后场上采访
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.94,EN,,0,0,0,,Alex big congratulations that was not easy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,恭喜你 亚历克斯 这真不容易
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.94,0:00:04.72,EN,,0,0,0,,with the rain delay you had the momentum
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.94,0:00:04.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,雨断之前你本来占着主动
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.72,0:00:07.34,EN,,0,0,0,,but you had to fight hard in the end
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.72,0:00:07.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,但最后关头拼得很艰难
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.34,0:00:09.00,EN,,0,0,0,,and dig deep how would you able
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.34,0:00:09.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,你是怎么咬牙坚持下来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.00,0:00:10.28,EN,,0,0,0,,to pull another tie breakout
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.00,0:00:10.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,又拼下一个抢七
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.28,0:00:12.38,EN,,0,0,0,,in a challenging match?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.28,0:00:12.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,打完这么胶着的一场球？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.38,0:00:15.18,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah look obviously you never really want
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.38,0:00:15.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,是啊 说实话谁都不想
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.18,0:00:17.42,EN,,0,0,0,,to go into rain delay being 5 -1 up I think
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.18,0:00:17.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,在五比一领先时碰上雨断
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.42,0:00:20.36,EN,,0,0,0,,it's it was a tough day there was five
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.42,0:00:20.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,那天真的很难熬 前后大概
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.36,0:00:24.18,EN,,0,0,0,,or six rain delays I can't remember a match
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.36,0:00:24.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,停了五六次雨 我想不起
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.18,0:00:26.22,EN,,0,0,0,,that I've had where there's
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.18,0:00:26.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有哪场球
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.22,0:00:27.42,EN,,0,0,0,,been so many starts and stops
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.22,0:00:27.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,这样反反复复地停过
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.42,0:00:30.32,EN,,0,0,0,,but I'm happy with the way I found
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.42,0:00:30.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,但我很高兴 最终
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.32,0:00:33.94,EN,,0,0,0,,a way I mean again it got it got tough
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.32,0:00:33.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,找到了办法 到最后确实
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.94,0:00:35.54,EN,,0,0,0,,at the end probably a little bit harder than it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.94,0:00:35.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,变得比原本
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.54,0:00:38.18,EN,,0,0,0,,should have been but I dug deep I got
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.54,0:00:38.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,更难打了 但我咬牙坚持
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.18,0:00:40.92,EN,,0,0,0,,through and I'm excited
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.18,0:00:40.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,拿下了 我很期待
