Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.84,0:00:44.84,EN,,0,0,0,,after a previous match too those challenges
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.84,0:00:44.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,上一场赛后你也说过 这种考验
